"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/121145","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121145","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121145.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121145.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\nEnsures the issue in #121139 cannot happen again, by having any documentation-only PRs run the `doctool` test against the most recently built `linux-editor-mono` artifact\r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\n\r\nAdds no additional build time to PRs that aren't documentation-exclusive. Will only check for artifacts from the default branch, so it should be the most up-to-date version of documentation at any given time. Will have potential for brief desyncs when a PR is updated shortly after a push to the defualt branch, but that's easily sussed out\r\n\r\nIdeally, we should have dedicated matrices built that can dynamically account for these build conditions and only run a single documentation build. Would require a larger-scale overhaul of the GHA structure before that could be realistically pursued","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121145/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":1},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121145/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}